===Go forth, to the silent graves{{subst:void|<!--104061117-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=trailblaze|location="Warbling Shores" Styxia|update|Just as one clutches the flame of hope, traversing through the twilight of their destined life until they reach their grave.<br />Just as you, embracing your hope, have arrived at time's end in fulfillment.<br />Go now. Farewell. By the temple lies a heaven-made sanctuary.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}
;(По прибытии на место)

;(По прибытии на место)
:{{tx}}
----
:'''Hysilens's Memory:''' Cerydra...
:'''Hysilens's Memory:''' This will be the last time I carry out your decree.
:'''Hysilens's Memory:''' Ever since you took me under your banner and made me the Dux Gladiorum, my music has belonged to others. Time and time again, I used the siren's song to lure the unwary into illusions for your schemes and strategies...
:'''Hysilens's Memory:''' {{Цвет|Ключевой|nobold=1|Now... let the siren "Helektra" sing for herself. Let me step into an endless dream of my own making.}}
:'''Hysilens's Memory:''' {{Цвет|Ключевой|nobold=1|O great ocean! I offer you the rest of my clarity and my freedom, in exchange for the strength to stand against the "Nihility"... and honor the sacrifices of the fallen heroes.}}
:'''Hysilens's Memory:''' Gray Fry, Deliverer from beyond the sky...
:'''Hysilens's Memory:''' When you ride the current of time and find your way here, you'll hear my solo. It will guide you to the heart of this world.
:'''Hysilens's Memory:''' By then, I may still be lost in my self-wrought slumber. But I'll uphold my part of this long relay and guard the shackles that seal the Theoros.
:'''Hysilens's Memory:''' Do you still remember? To awaken someone from a siren's voice, you'll need...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Phagousa's Honeydew...
:'''Hysilens's Memory:''' The gift I once gave you... May you still have it when the time comes.
